Bootstrap: localimage
From: /vol/projects/BIIM/agentic_immunology/singularity/ciim_R_base.sif

%labels
    Author jalil.nourisa@gmail.com
    Description Aging clocks (R) — ciim_R_base + scImmuAging (single-cell immune aging, PBMC)

%post
    set -e

    # ── Extra CRAN deps not in ciim_R_base ───────────────────────────────────
    Rscript -e '
        pkgs <- c("glmnet", "ggpubr", "infotheo", "ggridges", "Matrix")
        install.packages(pkgs, repos="https://cloud.r-project.org")
        miss <- pkgs[!pkgs %in% rownames(installed.packages())]
        if (length(miss)) { cat("FAILED CRAN:", paste(miss, collapse=", "), "\n"); quit(status=1) }
        cat("CRAN extras OK\n")
    '

    # ── scImmuAging from GitHub ───────────────────────────────────────────────
    Rscript -e '
        remotes::install_github("CiiM-Bioinformatics-group/scImmuAging",
                                upgrade="never", dependencies=FALSE)
        if (!"scImmuAging" %in% rownames(installed.packages())) {
            cat("FAILED: scImmuAging not installed\n"); quit(status=1)
        }
        cat("scImmuAging OK\n")
    '

    # ── Sanity check ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Rscript -e '
        suppressMessages(library(scImmuAging))
        cat("scImmuAging loads OK\n")
    '

%environment
    export LC_ALL=C.UTF-8
    export LANG=C.UTF-8

%runscript
    exec Rscript "$@"

%help
    Aging clocks — R image.

    Inherits from ciim_R_base.sif:
        R 4.4.1, Seurat v5, Signac, tidyverse, ggplot2, ComplexHeatmap,
        limma, edgeR, GenomicRanges, SingleCellExperiment, ...

    Adds:
        glmnet, ggpubr, infotheo, ggridges — scImmuAging dependencies
        biomaRt                             — gene annotation
        scImmuAging (CiiM-Bioinformatics-group/scImmuAging)
            — cell-type-specific PBMC immune aging clocks (scRNA-seq)
            — cell types: CD4T, CD8T, NK, B, Monocyte
            — input: Seurat object with metadata columns donor_id + age

    COMPAT NOTES (Seurat v5 + glmnet 5.0 — patch required at runtime):
    1. options(Seurat.object.assay.version="v3") before CreateSeuratObject()
    2. Patch scImmuAging::pre_fun via assignInNamespace() to call
       glmnet:::predict.glmnet() directly (glmnet 5.0 S3 dispatch broken)
    3. Pass rownames(model$glmnet.fit$beta) as marker_gene (not all_features)
    See aging_clock_agent.md for the complete boilerplate.

    Usage:
        singularity exec \
            --bind /vol/projects:/vol/projects \
            agentic_immunology/singularity/aging_clocks_R.sif \
            Rscript agentic_immunology/temp/{task}/script.R
